---
---

<figure class="fig">
  <div class="panel panel--competitor">
    <div class="panel-head">
      <span class="panel-label">DBOS</span>
      <span class="panel-sub">Deterministic workflow, every step durable</span>
    </div>
    <div class="code">
      <span class="mono dim">@DBOS.workflow()</span>
      <span class="mono primary">def review_flow(topic):</span>
      <span class="mono indented primary">brief = research_step(topic)</span>
      <span class="mono indented primary">draft = draft_step(brief)</span>
      <span class="mono indented muted"># side effects must live in a step</span>
    </div>
    <div class="constraint">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3 L12 13 M12 17 L12 17.5" /><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" /></svg>
      <span>No if/while/try in the workflow body. Random or time-based code breaks replay.</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="panel panel--kitaru">
    <div class="panel-head">
      <span class="panel-label panel-label--accent">Kitaru</span>
      <span class="panel-sub">Plain Python, checkpoint what's expensive</span>
    </div>
    <div class="code">
      <span class="mono accent">@flow</span>
      <span class="mono primary">def review_flow(topic):</span>
      <span class="mono indented primary">brief = research(topic)</span>
      <span class="mono indented muted">if needs_review(brief):</span>
      <span class="mono indented-2 primary">draft = refine(brief)</span>
      <span class="mono indented muted">else:</span>
      <span class="mono indented-2 primary">draft = publish(brief)</span>
    </div>
    <div class="checkpoints">
      <div class="chip chip--accent">
        <span class="chip-key">@checkpoint</span>
        <span class="chip-val">research → brief.json</span>
      </div>
      <div class="chip chip--accent">
        <span class="chip-key">@checkpoint</span>
        <span class="chip-val">refine → draft.md</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="replay">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12 A9 9 0 1 0 6 5 L3 8 M3 3 L3 8 L8 8" /></svg>
      <span>Fix a bug at step 9. Replay loads cached artifacts for 1 through 8.</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</figure>

<style>
  .fig {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .panel {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 16px 16px 18px;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .panel--competitor { background: var(--color-surface-warm); }

  .panel-head { margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .panel-label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .panel-label--accent { color: var(--color-accent); }
  .panel-sub {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
  }

  .code {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
    padding: 12px;
    background: var(--color-bg);
    border-radius: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .mono {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }
  .indented { padding-left: 18px; }
  .indented-2 { padding-left: 36px; }
  .primary { color: var(--color-primary); }
  .accent { color: var(--color-accent); font-weight: 600; }
  .dim { color: var(--color-muted); }
  .muted { color: var(--color-secondary); }

  .constraint {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: auto;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px dashed var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
  }
  .constraint svg {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    margin-top: 2px;
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--color-muted);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
    stroke-linecap: round;
  }

  .checkpoints {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .chip {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 7px 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    font-size: 11.5px;
  }
  .chip--accent {
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    background: var(--color-accent-light);
  }
  .chip-key {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 11px;
  }
  .chip-val {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-size: 11px;
  }

  .replay {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: 10px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
  }
  .replay svg {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--color-accent);
    stroke-width: 1.6;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .fig { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
